---
layout: layouts/base.njk
nav: support
title: Support us
description: DeliverCon costs almost nothing to run, and we'd like to keep it that way.
---
<div class="dc-space">
  <div class="dc-starfield" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="dc-star" style="left:10%;top:14%;width:26px;height:33px;opacity:.85;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(207,230,255,.55))"></span>
    <span class="dc-star" style="left:80%;top:70%;width:20px;height:25px;background:#ffe3b8;opacity:.7;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 9px rgba(207,230,255,.45))"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="dc-container" style="padding:46px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:start">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
      <h1 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--text-heading)">Help us keep it free.</h1>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;max-width:46ch">DeliverCon costs almost nothing to run, and we'd like to keep it that way. What we need is space, sandwiches and stationery — not a headline slot.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a href="mailto:info@delivercon.uk?subject=Offering%20a%20venue%20for%20DeliverCon" class="dc-btn dc-btn--primary">Offer a venue</a>
        <a href="mailto:info@delivercon.uk?subject=Volunteering%20for%20DeliverCon" class="dc-btn dc-btn--outline">Volunteer with us</a>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:6px">
        <img src="/assets/images/brand/ukgovcamp-logo.png" alt="UKGovCamp" style="height:44px;display:block">
        <span style="font-size:16px;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:36ch">Grant-funded by UKGovCamp since 2024. Sponsors get a thank-you slide and a sticker — that's the deal.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dc-needs-list">
      <div class="dc-need">
        <span class="dc-need__icon" aria-hidden="true">🏢</span>
        <p>A room for the day — five breakout spaces and space for 200. This is the thing we need most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-need">
        <span class="dc-need__icon" aria-hidden="true">🥪</span>
        <p>Lunch, or a contribution towards it — the thing that gets strangers talking to each other.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-need">
        <span class="dc-need__icon" aria-hidden="true">✋</span>
        <p>Time on the day — running a room, on the door, or writing up notes.</p>
      </div>
      <span style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px">No sponsorship packages, no logos on stage — just tell us what you can offer and we'll work it out together.</span>
      <span class="dc-eyebrow-line" style="margin-top:4px">info@delivercon.uk · #DeliverCon</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
